  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-16T13:11:23.186904Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-16T13:29:56.329965Z",
  "totalBlocks": 29,
  "translatedBlocks": 29,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "641cbfbab4c05283",
      "translationZh": "今天，在 Microsoft Build 大会上，Satya Nadella 宣布扩大与 Hugging Face 的合作，让其种类丰富的开放模型能够轻松部署到 Azure 的安全基础设施上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c28441303c90b40",
      "translationZh": "如果你今天访问 Azure AI Foundry，就会发现其中的 Hugging Face 模型集合已大幅扩充，数量达到 10,000+，只需点击几下即可部署，为处理文本、音频和图像的 AI 应用提供支持。而这仅仅是个开始！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0306bdd8e177499e",
      "translationZh": "是时候开始构建了——进一步扩大的合作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7dfb359fc6e4645",
      "translationZh": "2 年前，Microsoft 与 Hugging Face 开始合作，让用户能够更轻松地在 Azure 上获取开放模型——当时，Hub 上托管着 200,000 个开放模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f67ae0673a84ddd",
      "translationZh": "如今，Hugging Face 上已有近 200 万个开放模型，涵盖丰富多样的任务、模态、领域和语言，是时候将我们的合作提升到新的水平了。今天宣布的新合作建立了一个实现双方共同成功的框架，大幅拓展 Azure 客户从 Hugging Face 获益的途径。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7bd84cebe127083f",
      "translationZh": "“开源让 AI 更快地向前发展，其核心是透明、选择和社区。此次合作体现了我们对延续这一发展势头的承诺。通过将 Hugging Face 充满活力的模型生态系统与 Azure 安全的企业级基础设施相结合，我们赋予开发者为具体任务选择最佳模型的自由，并帮助组织安全地开展规模化创新。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e8b7b12f198aad32",
      "translationZh": "——Asha Sharma，Microsoft 公司副总裁",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f00bfcba7385eec8",
      "translationZh": "让 Azure 客户能够轻松获取更多开放模型，并将其与公司私有数据一同安全部署，将使企业能够在完全掌控自身技术和数据的同时，构建 AI 应用和智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3271841e340b0996",
      "translationZh": "我们正在帮助企业掌控自身的 AI 未来，在其 Azure 账户内安全地部署最优秀的开放模型，从而构建值得信赖且可验证的 AI 应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8e25d5ffcfe29b8",
      "translationZh": "——Clement Delangue，Hugging Face 首席执行官兼联合创始人",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6fc6c5434ea61387",
      "translationZh": "如何在 Azure AI Foundry 中使用 Hugging Face",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43d91f82af9620b3",
      "translationZh": "让我们前往 Azure AI Foundry，并选择模型目录（Model Catalog）。现在，你可以在 Hugging Face 集合中找到超过 10,000 个模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9efe2cae98e8909",
      "translationZh": "该集合中的模型包括 Hugging Face 上最受欢迎、热度最高的模型，可用于处理文本、音频和图像的广泛任务，包括文本生成、特征提取、掩码填充、翻译、识别句子相似度、图像分类、图像分割、文本生成图像、图像转文本、自动语音识别和音频分类。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a15f8ace0d18cc1b",
      "translationZh": "为了让 Azure AI Foundry 上的 Hugging Face 集合满足企业级使用要求，我们仅收录符合以下条件的模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "539eb54874fec1e6",
      "translationZh": "已成功通过 Hugging Face 安全测试，以筛查任何漏洞，其中包括使用 ProtectAI Guardian 和 JFrog 安全扫描器进行的测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e8f4fb23c03874fd",
      "translationZh": "模型权重以 safetensors 格式存储，避免潜在的 Pickle 漏洞",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d288d3eecb5f611a",
      "translationZh": "不使用远程代码，以避免在运行时插入任何任意代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5494386d91009b2",
      "translationZh": "此外，Microsoft 和 Hugging Face 将持续检测推理容器中的漏洞，以便根据需要进行维护和修补。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "876864cf1669e43b",
      "translationZh": "现在，假设你想部署一个模型，例如广受欢迎的 Microsoft Phi-4 Reasoning Plus 开放模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a5c7bceb26410c8",
      "translationZh": "首先，在 Azure AI Foundry 的 Hugging Face Collection 中选择该模型，然后点击“部署按钮”。你可以在表单中选择虚拟机、实例数量和部署参数，然后只需再点击一次即可启动部署流程！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07a8149f5f9a6101",
      "translationZh": "现在，如果你更喜欢在 Hub 上浏览模型，也可以从模型页面开始——“在 Azure ML 上部署”选项会将你带到 Azure AI Machine Learning Studio 中的同一部署选项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "83a463c2c3019d31",
      "translationZh": "更多 Hugging Face 内容即将登陆 Azure AI Foundry",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2d977c803612009",
      "translationZh": "如今，众多新的 Hugging Face 模型和模态都已可以直接在 Azure AI Foundry 中使用，这让我们倍感兴奋，但我们不会止步于此！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "216664f045bf1973",
      "translationZh": "在接下来的几周和几个月里，你可以期待一波接一波、如滚滚雷声般接踵而至的更新：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "41ecb3e3b820597d",
      "translationZh": "首日发布——Hugging Face 将与 Microsoft 合作，让顶级模型提供商的新模型在登陆 Hugging Face 的当天，即可在 Azure AI Foundry 上使用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0653f0d90b3325f1",
      "translationZh": "热门模型更新——Hugging Face 将持续关注热门模型，每天将其引入 Azure AI Foundry",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "390bd7937b8bd1d1",
      "translationZh": "新模态——Hugging Face 和 Microsoft 将携手支持更多模态和特定领域的任务，包括视频、3D、时间序列、蛋白质等。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b69e6d57f171c9e4",
      "translationZh": "智能体与工具——小巧、高效、专用的开放模型，是构建强大而安全的 AI 智能体和应用的理想选择",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe74a85276c48aa9",
      "translationZh": "如果你正在使用 Azure，现在就开始用开放模型构建吧！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
